abstract: >-
  An AI-augmented exam assessment pipeline that assists teachers with
  structured, rubric-based assessment of student examinations. Built as
  MCP servers for use with AI assistants, supporting the complete workflow
  from PDF conversion through qualitative assessment to formative feedback.
